<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Vitro sets April 25 annual meeting.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Vitro sets April 25 annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of glass and industrial giant Vitro SA has called an annual general meeting (AGM) on April 25 here in this northern industrial city, the company said Tuesday.</p>
<p>One item on the agenda, the company said in statements published in local media, will be a discussion of expanding information regarding results the company makes public.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau +528 3457617))</p>
